  "body": "I noticed that the [hyperlink auditing section](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/commit-snapshots/0777f6ddda146ff7973b9fc1273d4c16ff92dc3b/#hyperlink-auditing) doesn't actually set the [Fetch keepalive flag](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#request-keepalive-flag). Given that one of the main reasons for existence of this feature is to have a request that outlives the parent document, the flag should probably be set. :)",
